  "name": "Automated Website Scraper & RAG Chatbot",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "e8ecbc66-d72d-42e5-9aa8-841fcf25a936",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1104,
        576
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 580,
        "height": 1480,
        "content": "# \ud83c\udf10 Website Scraper & RAG Chatbot\n### Firecrawl + Pinecone + Google Gemini\n\nCrawls any website, stores its content in Pinecone, and runs a chat agent that answers only from that content.\n\n### How it works\n1. Submit the **Website URL Form**\n2. The Pinecone namespace is cleared so reruns never create duplicates\n3. Firecrawl maps every URL on the site\n4. URLs are cleaned, deduped and junk paths removed\n5. Each page is fetched one by one with a 2s delay\n6. HTML is stripped to plain text; pages under 50 characters are skipped\n7. Text is split into 1000-char chunks with 200-char overlap\n8. Chunks are embedded with Gemini and saved to Pinecone\n9. The chat agent answers questions using only the retrieved chunks\n\n### Setup\n1. **Firecrawl API** credential\n2. **Pinecone** credential and a **dense** index (not \"integrated model\"). The index dimension must match your Gemini embedding model (768 for text-embedding-004)\n3. **Google Gemini API** credential (chat model and both embedding nodes)\n4. Replace `YOUR_PINECONE_INDEX` and `YOUR_PINECONE_NAMESPACE` in both Pinecone nodes and both HTTP Request nodes\n5. Activate the workflow and open the chat\n\n### Customize\n- Edit blocked keywords in **Filter and Normalize URLs**\n- Change chunk size or overlap in **Split Text into Chunks**\n- Change the assistant's name or tone in the **Customer Support Agent** system message"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "be2ea160-81d8-4e17-8d7b-0a4fd144a4ca",
      "name": "Section 1 - Start & Reset",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1744,
        576
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 840,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## 1. Start & reset\nSubmit the form with a website URL. The two HTTP nodes look up your Pinecone index host and wipe the namespace, so every run rebuilds the knowledge base from scratch with no duplicate vectors."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8b3bed86-5ac0-4ae2-b6e6-82fed20329a5",
      "name": "Section 2 - Discover URLs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2624,
        576
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 800,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## 2. Discover & clean URLs\nFirecrawl maps the site's URLs. A Code node drops press/newsletter/gallery/.xml paths, trailing slashes and duplicates, then pages are processed one at a time with a 2-second delay."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01c59f3-c73a-473d-aa43-99532b750719",
      "name": "Section 3 - Fetch & Extract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3472,
        576
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 820,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## 3. Fetch & extract text\nEach page's HTML is downloaded, script/style tags and markup are stripped, and pages with less than 50 characters of text are skipped."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f8441611-62be-4cff-9270-17ef52e9e0dd",
      "name": "Section 4 - Chunk & Store",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4336,
        576
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 760,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## 4. Chunk & store\nText is split into 1000-char chunks (200 overlap), embedded with Gemini, and inserted into Pinecone with the page URL as metadata."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "117a18d4-7590-4f31-9319-b8ba9739c5cc",
      "name": "Section 5 - RAG Chat Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1744,
        1264
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 960,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "## 5. RAG chat agent\nA public chat trigger feeds the agent. It uses Gemini as the model, keeps the last 10 messages in memory, and searches Pinecone (with the same Gemini embeddings used at ingestion) before answering."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
